# Anything derived from the game client stays out of version control.
#
# A modified AreaTable.dbc is Blizzard's file with one bit changed: it carries all 2307 of their area
# records, including every area name in sixteen languages. That is their content, and committing or
# distributing it would be distributing their content. The tools beside this file are ours and carry
# none of it -- they read a client you already own.
*.dbc
*.MPQ
*.mpq
makepatch
